epoch 3: D/G=1.06327/-0.0560048, orthogonal=1.43595e-07
fixed final=3, test D/G=1.05479/-0.0504587, class/projection effects=0.187669/0.465906; hierarchical/CCBN/residual/SN/projection/orthogonal/rejection/restore/immutable PASS (training 0.496623 s)
