> Hold eight latent codes fixed and change the requested class

Rows 0 through 9 supply the ten class labels; every row reuses the same first eight
fixed latent codes. The maximum pixel effect across classes is about.187669, confirming
an active conditional path. Pixel dependence does not establish that each row depicts
its requested digit. The raw G embedding is shared by its two conditional normalizers;
D has its own separate spectral projection table.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/big_gan_classes.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
